        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Pair of square mandarin rank badges of silk tapestry (kesi) in coloured silks and gold thread.\n\nEach square is woven with a design of an egret, the insignia of a civil official of the sixth rank, and a background of water, waves, rocks, clouds and Taoist symbols.\n\nFront square is 11.25 x 11 ins, back square: 11 x 11.5 ins."@en ;
